{"v":4,"catch":"一杯に宿る、静かな美\n一つひとつの所作に、心を込めて\n日常で味わう、日本の茶の道","desc":"静かな一杯に、深い世界がある。\nこの本では、日本茶の種類や味わい方、歴史とともに、茶道の基本や精神も学ぶことができます。\nお茶を点てる所作に込められた「おもてなし」の心、そして日本文化の美しさを、初心者にもわかりやすく丁寧に紹介します。\n日常の中で、日本茶をもっと豊かに楽しむための一冊です。","publisher":"Lunaria Games","release":"2025-06-12","genres":["學習","實用","交流","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日本語","英語"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"3+","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5f4e44fd76976c47621f913fe9b403832a3d95e2b83320c045dbe7a69eda01ef.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/59e3ec705e76be14e8fe8db49f8bc94e81288ccf188debf63329093e7cd84db3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/829383a499612ec8057c2798b1a6972828e911ff92ae582ccb0b26cabd12b79a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/33166715ae713dea6d7fe958491a9d1d1fc3ae3d33935db91e61314b7f11499a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/dfaa65ed54d291e482f5fa1e3aef96dfb10edfd15c4d1cb3134ac133e06d2be8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/47535c016b8f4d27e2d338ea36f976f91c73563ac7ff6ccd99e9d817fa335f1a.jpg"],"titleId":"0100e330239ce000"}